WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:03.753
Hello, Mr. Kishibe!

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:06.423
It's such a nice day!

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.966
MINORU KAIGAMORI, AGE 23, EDITOR

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:09.759
What are you reading?

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:11.970
De Staël.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.346
Dostarl?

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:15.598
Is it a new band or something?

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:22.439
He was a Russian artist. He died in 1955.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:25.650
Listen, Kaigamori.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:27.152
ROHAN KISHIBE, AGE 27, MANGA ARTIST

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.987
Of course,
it's absolutely unacceptable

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.990
for a professional to be late
for a business appointment, but…

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.994
it's also not right for an editor
to arrive&nbsp;six minutes early

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:39.330
for an&nbsp;appointment&nbsp;with a manga artist!

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:44.002
I'm sorry. So coming early is wrong too.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.254
You were lucky it was me this time.

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:50.759
Now, let's talk about my next 61-page
one-shot manga, shall we?

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:53.720
Excuse me, Mr. Kishibe!&nbsp;We are your&nbsp;fans!

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:57.390
Could we have your autograph?
Please write "To Akira"!

00:00:57.474 --> 00:01:00.101
No, no! No autographs, you two!

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:04.314
Mr. Kishibe is busy! He's working!

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.690
I've signed them already.

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.736
Unlike some, I'm a fast worker.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:12.906
I always give my autograph
to thank my fans.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:17.202
Wow! How did you do that?!
Drip painting using coffee!

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:19.496
Thanks, buddy. You rock!

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.081
Gotcha, gotcha, gotcha!

